  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati Gender Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&#x2019;s support to Kiribati has been guided by the Kiribati Gender Country Plan under the Pacific Women Lead Program, a 5-year AUD$170million gender equality investment, with the goal for women and girls, in all their diversity, to be safe and equitable share in resources, opportunities and decision-making with men and boys. The priority areas of the program include:  women&apos;s leadership promoted; women&#x2019;s right realised;  and increased ownership and effectiveness of regional gender equality efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
