   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender equality</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati: An unemployed 40-year-old survivor, married at 16 years with 8 children, experienced ongoing physical and economic abuse from partner, husband left her, leaving her to support their children alone. Without money and home, survivor stayed with family who referred her to KWCSC counsellors. Through KWCSC the survivor accessed counselling services, was empowered to access law and justice services for protection order and child maintenance support, accompaniment to open bank account, and ongoing counselling support.
&#x200d;
Timely provision of critical support services has now enabled survivor to successfully undertake income-generating activities to support family financially and enjoy life free of violence.</narrative>
    </description>
